<title>USA: Teleport Comm wins Milwaukee pact.</title>
<headline>Teleport Comm wins Milwaukee pact.</headline>
<dateline>ST. LOUIS 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Teleport Communications Group Inc said Monday its TCG Milwaukee unit won a contract to install a telecommunications system at Cardinal Stritch College in Milwaukee.</p>
<p>TCG said the system will eventually include 1,000 lines of service linking administrative offices and dormitory rooms at the Franciscan institition to one central office.</p>
<p>Financial terms were not announced.</p>
<p>TCG offers local telephone exchange services in 57 major metropolitan markets.</p>
<p>Its shares were trading off 3/8 Monday at 27-3/4.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
